WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.941
Log in to Homlle. Click the map pin on

00:00:02.941 --> 00:00:05.282
the left to open Jobs Map. Here you can

00:00:05.282 --> 00:00:06.583
look for work near you.

00:00:08.283 --> 00:00:11.690
Select a job and read its details. Check the

00:00:11.690 --> 00:00:15.097
location, time, pay and tasks. Only accept work you

00:00:15.097 --> 00:00:16.233
can safely complete.

00:00:17.933 --> 00:00:20.881
On your dashboard, click Accept job. Your accepted job

00:00:20.881 --> 00:00:23.830
appears in your schedule. Open the booking when you

00:00:23.830 --> 00:00:25.140
are ready to go.

00:00:26.840 --> 00:00:30.184
Read the access details and customer notes. Check what

00:00:30.184 --> 00:00:33.529
needs doing before you start. If anything is unclear,

00:00:33.529 --> 00:00:34.643
contact the customer.

00:00:36.343 --> 00:00:39.217
Use Start journey when you leave, then record your

00:00:39.217 --> 00:00:42.090
arrival at the property. When ready to begin, click

00:00:42.090 --> 00:00:42.729
Start cleaning.

00:00:44.429 --> 00:00:47.906
Do each task first. Then click Mark task complete

00:00:47.906 --> 00:00:51.383
beside it. Repeat for the remaining tasks. Record any

00:00:51.383 --> 00:00:52.155
problem honestly.

00:00:53.855 --> 00:00:57.238
Photograph the finished work. On your phone, use Take

00:00:57.238 --> 00:01:00.621
a job photo. This example uses Choose existing photo

00:01:00.621 --> 00:01:02.124
to select a picture.

00:01:03.824 --> 00:01:07.153
Choose After cleaning. Link the task and add a

00:01:07.153 --> 00:01:10.482
useful note. Click Upload securely. Wait for confirmation that

00:01:10.482 --> 00:01:11.961
your photo has saved.

00:01:13.661 --> 00:01:16.906
Check your work and all tasks. Save the completion

00:01:16.906 --> 00:01:20.151
photos and record any issues. Click Finish cleaning, then

00:01:20.151 --> 00:01:21.233
confirm when asked.

00:01:22.933 --> 00:01:26.224
The customer opens your private photos and checks the

00:01:26.224 --> 00:01:29.516
task record. Clear photos help them see what you

00:01:29.516 --> 00:01:31.710
have completed. Keep personal information out.

00:01:33.410 --> 00:01:36.795
When satisfied, the customer clicks Confirm job complete. That

00:01:36.795 --> 00:01:40.179
completes the booking. You can check your records in

00:01:40.179 --> 00:01:41.307
Activity and Earnings.